{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap in and hover up! <i>Hover Rancher</i> is a story-driven point-and-click adventure that blends exploration, tactical deployment, and high-octane minigames into one unforgettable ride. As a lone rancher in a futuristic frontier, you\u2019ll traverse vast, vibrant landscapes in your trusty hovercraft, harvesting rare resources, completing missions, and building outposts in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this isn\u2019t just about ranching\u2014<i>Hover Rancher</i> throws you into adrenaline-fueled minigames like high-speed snowboarding down alien mountainsides, engaging in intense aerial dogfights, and outsmarting rival hover ranchers in strategic skirmishes. Each location you visit holds secrets, side quests, and characters to meet\u2014or outmaneuver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:<br>\u2022 A unique hovercraft-driven point-and-click adventure<br>\u2022 Mini-games including snowboarding, dogfighting, and more<br>\u2022 Deployable units and strategic combat scenarios<br>\u2022 A colorful, open-ended world to explore<br>\u2022 Dialogue-rich storytelling and quirky characters<br>\u2022 Customize your hovercraft and ranch outposts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re taming the skies or carving up a frozen canyon, <i>Hover Rancher</i> offers an adventure as vast and varied as the world you're reclaiming.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879350?t=1759326241","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879350/2078824cfcdbe673a5b4feba3e394d0f5f3e7ef8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759326241","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879350/7d9fe116d0c89cccb51104f72388a5666bec2879/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759326241","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879350/7d9fe116d0c89cccb51104f72388a5666bec2879/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759326241","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap in and hover up! <i>Hover Rancher</i> is a story-driven point-and-click adventure that blends exploration, tactical deployment, and high-octane minigames into one unforgettable ride. As a lone rancher in a futuristic frontier, you\u2019ll traverse vast, vibrant landscapes in your trusty hovercraft, harvesting rare resources, completing missions, and building outposts in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this isn\u2019t just about ranching\u2014<i>Hover Rancher</i> throws you into adrenaline-fueled minigames like high-speed snowboarding down alien mountainsides, engaging in intense aerial dogfights, and outsmarting rival hover ranchers in strategic skirmishes. Each location you visit holds secrets, side quests, and characters to meet\u2014or outmaneuver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:<br>\u2022 A unique hovercraft-driven point-and-click adventure<br>\u2022 Mini-games including snowboarding, dogfighting, and more<br>\u2022 Deployable units and strategic combat scenarios<br>\u2022 A colorful, open-ended world to explore<br>\u2022 Dialogue-rich storytelling and quirky characters<br>\u2022 Customize your hovercraft and ranch outposts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re taming the skies or carving up a frozen canyon, <i>Hover Rancher</i> offers an adventure as vast and varied as the world you're reclaiming.</p>","developers":["Matt Mateo Vii"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879350/fe7aaec17c82f99f496ae84e0951141c9e7c8731/header.jpg?t=1759326241","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamsta